  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Standard Microgrid Initiatives Limited Deployment Microgrid Units, through DNV Energy Insights USA, Inc.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This grant to Standard Microgrid Initiatives Limited funds a feasibility study and site assessment for the deployment of an estimated 125 standardized microgrid units in Zambia. The Study will demonstrate the competitiveness of U.S. solar and storage technologies in a relatively untapped market, and is anticipated to provide access to electricity for up to 22,500 households. The Project is expected to serve as the first large-scale deployment of photovoltaic solar with storage microgrids in rural and peri-urban Zambia.</narrative>
  </description>
